cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DYNAMICS-8 in your research, please cite the preprint."
type: software
title: "DYNAMICS-8 — An Eight-Dimension Personality Framework for Computational Behavioural Simulation"
abstract: >-
  DYNAMICS-8 is an eight-dimension personality framework for computational
  behavioural simulation. The model retains six validated dimensions from
  Big Five and HEXACO personality science and introduces two new dimensions
  addressing digital fluency and reward sensitivity (Acuity and Impulsivity).
  Validation against 1,000 synthetic personas confirmed all hypotheses with
  effect sizes ranging from 0.21 to 5.32. The framework is the basis for
  the persona panels used in Kronaxis Panel Studio, KPM-1 election
  forecasting, and the broader Kronaxis research stack.
